  "description": "Microsoft Agent Framework (MAF) bridge for TgLLM.NET: turns an agent's human-in-the-loop tool approval into an owner-scoped, single-use Telegram button, reusing the Tool Router, edit-in-place, and durable bindings from the earlier slices. MAF is confined to this leaf (pinned to an exact version) so TgLLM.Core and both façades stay agent-framework-agnostic.",
